+// install takes slot i (word index) for mine if it still holds w0/w1. It
+// clears word1 before publishing word0, so between the two writes readers
+// see fp with word1 == 0 ("claim in flight") rather than a stranger's tag.
+func (f *Filter) install(i int, w0, w1, mine uint64) bool {
